  "item_short_desc": "<p>Embrace classic style and extreme utility with Rothco's Vintage Vietnam Style Boonie Hat. Crafted from 100% rip-stop cotton, this hat offers durability and authenticity reminiscent of the Vietnam era. This tactical bucket hat features an adjustable chin strap for a customized fit, enhanced ventilation with 4 screened side vents, and a wide, 3-inch brim for ample sun protection. One size fits most (head sizes from 7 to 7 3/4), making the vintage boonie hat versatile for various wearers and occasions.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "6905",
  "description": "<p>Embrace classic style and extreme utility with Rothco's Vintage Vietnam Style Boonie Hat. Crafted from 100% rip-stop cotton, this hat offers durability and authenticity reminiscent of the Vietnam era. This tactical bucket hat features an adjustable chin strap for a customized fit, enhanced ventilation with 4 screened side vents, and a wide, 3-inch brim for ample sun protection. One size fits most (head sizes from 7 to 7 3/4), making the vintage boonie hat versatile for various wearers and occasions. This tactical boonie hat is perfect for outdoor activities, such as hiking, fishing, hunting, or simply adding a touch of vintage flair to your ensemble. Keep your head in the game with Rothco&rsquo;s collection of headwear and accessories. Designed with precision and purpose, our headgear is built to withstand the harshest conditions. Whether you&rsquo;re tackling the cold in one of our Watch Caps or Balaclavas, or out on a mission in a Boonie Hat or Fatigue Cap, our diverse range of headwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts.</p>",
